    "categoryTitle": "Men's Health",
    "shortDescription": "Compounded Sildenafil and Tadalafil combined into a single oral dissolving tablet. Fast onset, long duration, no water needed.",
    "description": "<h2>What is Sildenafil/Tadalafil ODT?</h2><p>Sildenafil/Tadalafil 55/22mg ODT is a compounded oral dissolving tablet that combines the two most studied PDE5 inhibitors used for erectile function in one easy dose. Sildenafil is the active ingredient famous for its rapid onset, while Tadalafil is known for its extended duration. Pairing them in a single dissolvable tablet is designed to give men both fast and sustained response in one daily option.</p><h3>How It Works</h3><p>Both Sildenafil and Tadalafil belong to a class of medications called PDE5 inhibitors. They work by blocking the enzyme phosphodiesterase type 5, which allows blood vessels in the penis to relax and fill with blood more easily during sexual stimulation. Sildenafil typically takes effect within 30 to 60 minutes and lasts about 4 to 6 hours. Tadalafil takes effect in 30 to 60 minutes as well but can remain active in the body for up to 36 hours. Combining the two creates a window of responsiveness that starts quickly and extends longer than either compound alone.</p><h3>Key Benefits</h3><p>The dual-action formula is designed for men who want flexibility and reliability without scheduling around a pill. The oral dissolving tablet form bypasses the swallowing step entirely, dissolves under the tongue, and is absorbed through the oral mucosa for quicker uptake than traditional tablets. No water needed, no waiting, and a more discreet dosing experience. Many men prefer the ODT format for travel, spontaneity, and ease of use.</p><h3>What to Expect</h3><p>Place one tablet under the tongue and let it dissolve completely. Most men report onset of effect within 20 to 40 minutes, with peak benefit at 1 to 2 hours and continued responsiveness for many hours afterward. Effects require sexual stimulation to produce a response. Side effects can include mild headache, flushing, nasal congestion, or indigestion. Avoid combining with nitrates or alpha-blockers and discuss any cardiovascular concerns with a licensed healthcare provider before use.</p><h3>Quality &amp; Sourcing</h3><p>Every Sildenafil/Tadalafil ODT formulation from Greenstone Wellness is compounded in the USA by licensed pharmacy partners under USP 795 non-sterile compounding standards. Each batch is third-party tested for potency and content uniformity to ensure consistent dose delivery from tablet to tablet.</p>",
